## Iridium 1.0.17 - Connection Labels & Subscription Name Fix

### Fixed
- Connection labels (IPV4_LABEL, IPV6_LABEL) now properly appear in subscription URIs
- Fixed hardcoded "IPv4"/"IPv6" in show_user_uri.py

### Changed
- SUB_NAME is now fully customizable (no forced username prefix or emoji)
- SUB_NAME supports `{username}` placeholder if you want to include username
- Example: Set SUB_NAME to "MyVPN - {username}" for "MyVPN - john" format
- Or just "IridiumVPN" for a clean name without username
